export default "import { Meta } from '@storybook/addon-docs/blocks';\n\n<Meta title=\"Docs/Roadmap\" />\n\n# Roadmap\n\n> *Now → Next → Later → Future*\n\n---\n\n## Now — Foundation (v0.4.x)\n\nBuilding the core A2UI surface controller:\n\n- [x] Section CRUD — AI adds/removes prompt sections via `<add_role>` / `<remove_role>` tags\n- [x] AI control tags — `<switch_tab>`, `<run_prompt/>`, `<show_version>`, `<eval_grounding/>`\n- [x] Grounding metrics display — five evaluation bars in Trace tab with Healthy/Drifting toggle\n- [x] Chat tab defaults open — most recent conversation auto-loaded on mount\n- [x] Session-scoped conversations — each prompt owns its chat, linked via `conversation_id` on `prompt_sessions`\n- [x] Conversation persistence — API-first PostgreSQL, localStorage purged, Sentry-monitored\n- [x] BrowserRouter — clean URLs, no `#/` hash\n- [x] Exit notification gates — confirm + spinner overlay between navigation\n- [ ] Element ID layer — UUIDs on every DOM element (`data-section-id`, `data-run-id`)\n\n---\n\n## Next — Autonomy (v0.5.x)\n\nThe AI becomes self-directed within guardrails:\n\n- [ ] Autonomous loop — AI iterates until groundedness threshold met (`<loop_target>`)\n- [x] Save pipeline fix — compiled_output + conversation messages persist reliably *(2026-07-15)*\n- [ ] Figma Make automation — script transforms exports to flat structure\n- [ ] AI notification surface — loop convergence → user alert with iteration summary\n- [ ] Atomic session save — one API call, one transaction, all three columns\n\n---\n\n## Later — Enterprise (v0.6.x)\n\nGovernance, access control, and collaboration:\n\n- [ ] Role-based access — student / teacher / admin permission tiers\n- [ ] Audit trail — every AI action logged with timestamp, user, and context\n- [ ] Prompt sharing — export/import session packages as shareable bundles\n- [ ] Multi-model evaluation — compare outputs across models side-by-side\n- [ ] Approval queues — prompt changes require review before production deployment\n\n---\n\n## Future — Platform (v1.0)\n\nFrom tool to ecosystem:\n\n- [ ] Design system component management — full lifecycle governance\n- [ ] Prompt marketplace — publish, discover, and fork agent packages\n- [ ] Team collaboration — shared workspaces, real-time co-editing\n- [ ] CI/CD integration — automated prompt testing and deployment pipelines\n- [ ] Enterprise SSO — SAML/OIDC integration for corporate identity providers\n- [ ] Usage analytics — track prompt performance, model costs, team velocity\n\n---\n\n## Completed Milestones\n\n### v0.4.0-alpha — 2026-07-14\n- A2UI Control Surface plan (four-phase roadmap)\n- AI control tags fully wired (`<switch_tab>`, `<run_prompt/>`, `<show_version>`, `<eval_grounding>`)\n- Section CRUD listeners in PromptWorkspace\n- Grounding metrics panel in Trace tab\n- Chat defaults to open with auto-loaded conversation\n- `api_core.py` breaks circular imports between main.py and routers\n- Production site restored after deployment wipe\n- Router directory at correct location (`backend/routers/`)\n\n### v0.3.0 — 2026-07-13\n- Router split: `main.py` refactored into 8 router files\n- Sentry AI monitoring integration\n- Session handling and overlay UX improvements\n- CI deploy order fix (assets first, index.html last)\n\n---\n\n## Feature Dependency Graph\n\n```\nElement ID Layer\n    ↓\nAutonomous Loop ←── Save Pipeline Fix\n    ↓                    ↓\nAudit Trail ←── Atomic Session Save\n    ↓\nRole-Based Access\n    ↓\nPrompt Sharing → Prompt Marketplace\n```\n\nEach phase unlocks the next. Element IDs are the critical path — without them, the autonomous loop can't target specific sections and the audit trail can't track per-element changes.\n"